Third-party licenses
====================

Heft itself is under the MIT license (see LICENSE). It is built with the
open-source Rust libraries listed below, grouped by license, followed by the
text of each license.

The Windows version also contains three unmodified PawnIO modules
(AMDFamily17, IntelMSR and LpcIO) from PawnIO.Modules 0.2.11 by namazso,
under the GNU Lesser General Public License 2.1 or later. The license text is
in PAWNIO-LICENSE.txt in the Windows download, and the modules' source code
is at https://github.com/namazso/PawnIO.Modules.

